@host = http://localhost:8080

### Return home page external html file
GET {{host}}/

< index.html

### Return home page external html file, specify path
GET {{host}}/index.html

< index.html

### Return external json file
GET {{host}}/users

< users.json

### [201] Create random user
POST {{host}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "success": true,
    "id": {{$integer}},
    "name": "{{$name}}",
    "event": "{{$uuid}}"
}

### [400] Create user failure
POST {{host}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "success": false,
    "id":0
}

### Idempotent user creation
PUT {{host}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "success": true,
    "id": 1484,
    "name": "{{$name}}",
    "event": "{{$uuid}}"
}

### Get vars cats
GET {{host}}/names?type=cat
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "success": true,
    "type": "{{$type}}",
    "names": ["whiskers", "jigsaw", "burger", "bingo"]
}

### Get vars dogs
GET {{host}}/names?type=dog
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "success": true,
    "type": "{{$type}}",
    "names": ["rusty", "sparky", "surge", "bolt"]
}



### Return any user
GET {{host}}/users/:id
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "success": true,
    "id": {{$id}},
    "event": "{{$uuid}}",
    "name": "{{$name}}",
    "dog": "{{$firstName}}",
    "cat": "{{$lastName}}",
    "phone": "{{$phone}}",
    "login": "{{$user}}",
    "email": "{{$email}}",
    "activated": {{$bool}},
    "logins": {{$integer}},
    "score": {{$float}},
    "profile": "{{$file}}",
    "homepage": "{{$url}}",
    "server": "{{$server}}",
    "hash": "{{$hash}}",
    "lastLogin": {{$timestamp}},
    "time": "{{$isoTimestamp}}",
    "blurb": "{{$sentence}}"
}

### [204] Delete a user
DELETE {{host}}/users/:id

### Music Include
GET {{host}}/chords

< chords.txt

### Music embed
GET {{host}}/chords2
Content-Type: "text/plain; charset=utf-8"

          --- Chord Tones ---

Chord       Major       Minor       7th
-------     -------     -------     ----
C           C,E,G       C,Eb,G      Bb
D           D,F#,A      D,F,A       C
E           E,G#,B      E,G,B       D
F           F,A,C       F,Ab,C      Eb
G           G,B,D       G,Bb,D      F
A           A,C#,E      A,C,E       G
B           B,D#,F#     B,D,F#      A

Major chord - made up of the 1,3, and 5 note in that key's scale
Minor chord - flat the 3rd note of the scale
Augmented chord - sharp the 5th note of the scale
7th - flat the 7th note of the scale

### Return a status page
GET {{host}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "status": "ok",
    "uptime": "13:34  up 8 days, 33 mins"
}

### Return a page after a delay
@delay = 1500ms
GET {{host}}/delay
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ok",
  "message": "A bit delayed, right?"
}


### Return embedded HTML
GET {{host}}/index2.html
Content-Type: "text/html; charset=utf-8"

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Mock Docs 2</title>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>Welcome to Mock Docs 2</h1>
    <p>Hello, World 2!</p>
</body>
</html>

